{
  "description": "Graphene 5x2 test payload for the full end-to-end workflow. It keeps the 20/40/60/80/100 snapshot sweep, removes explicit seeds from the dataset blocks and training runs, and cuts the training budget down to 10 epochs so the UI can be watched end to end.",
  "source_reference_payloads": [
    "Comparison/config/graphene_5x2_snapshot_scaling_20_100_4seeds_payload.json",
    "Comparison/config/graphene_5x2_snapshot_scaling_20_100_4seeds_pipeline_config.yaml"
